### TITLE ###
PreselectOpensChecked
### DESCRIPTION ###
Preselected labels are checked in the first frame, and a label that matches no
option is ignored rather than erroring. Toggling the preselected row off and on
again returns it to its opening state.
### PROMPT ###
Pick
### OPTIONS ###
a
b
c
### PRESELECT ###
b
nope
### KEYS ###
down
space
space
enter
### SELECTED ###
b
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
Pick
> [ ] a
  [x] b
  [ ] c
--- frame 1 (down) ---
Pick
  [ ] a
> [x] b
  [ ] c
--- frame 2 (space) ---
Pick
  [ ] a
> [ ] b
  [ ] c
--- frame 3 (space) ---
Pick
  [ ] a
> [x] b
  [ ] c
--- frame 4 (enter) ---
Pick b

### TITLE ###
HintFooter
### DESCRIPTION ###
The hint renders under the list, where a user looking for the controls will be.
### PROMPT ###
Pick
### OPTIONS ###
a
b
### HINT ###
space to toggle, enter to confirm
### KEYS ###
enter
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
Pick
> [ ] a
  [ ] b
  space to toggle, enter to confirm
--- frame 1 (enter) ---
\"Pick "
